      "comment": "STARLIGHT TWIX (8) goes very well this course and distance starting 10 times for four wins and three minors. Was out of the placings last time (22.40) at Cannington in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 7 lengths. With a clean break looks hard to beat. CROCODILE CRAWL (2) collided in the run last time but kept coming to score a 0.8 lengths win (17.77) at this track in a Grade 5/6. Leading player again. WISECRACKER (1) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 297m behind Jolly Ollie (17.86) in a Grade 4/5. Was a winner the start prior. Great chance to atone. CHAROS LEGEND (4) generally performs well here at this distance.",
